# Cloudflare Workers (`@opennextjs/cloudflare`)

This project deploys with **OpenNext on Cloudflare Workers**, not Pages / next-on-pages.

## Deploy

| Setting | Value |
|---------|--------|
| Build | `pnpm run build` / `pnpm run build:worker` (`opennextjs-cloudflare build`) |
| Output | `.open-next/` (`main`: `.open-next/worker.js`, assets: `.open-next/assets`) |
| Worker name | `chat` (`wrangler.jsonc`) |
| Domain | `chat.bilauitmcuti.com` (UI `/`) + zone routes `bilauitmcuti.com/chat*` / `www.../chat*` |
| Compatibility | `nodejs_compat` |

Scripts: `pnpm preview`, `pnpm deploy`, `pnpm upload` (preview versions). `build` and `build:worker` both run OpenNext.

[`open-next.config.ts`](open-next.config.ts) sets `buildCommand: "next build"` so OpenNext does not call `pnpm build` (which would recurse into OpenNext).

**Do not** add `bilauitmcuti.com/_next*` routes — calendar Pages owns apex `/_next`. Chat assets use `/chat/_next/*`.

## Workers Builds (Git) — dashboard must match

Worker → **Settings → Build**:

| Setting | Value |
|---------|--------|
| Build command | `pnpm run build` or `pnpm run build:worker` |
| Deploy command | `npx wrangler deploy` |
| Non-production deploy | `npx wrangler versions upload` or `pnpm run upload` |

Both build scripts run `opennextjs-cloudflare build` and produce `.open-next/`. Deploy fails with `Could not find compiled Open Next config` only if the build step skipped OpenNext (e.g. a custom command that runs `next build` alone).

## Bindings

- Workers AI: `ai.binding: "AI"` in `wrangler.jsonc`
- AI Gateway: `vars.AI_GATEWAY_ID` (not a separate binding) — third arg to `env.AI.run()`
- Env access: `getCloudflareContext()` from `@opennextjs/cloudflare` (not `getOptionalRequestContext`)

## Do not

- Reintroduce `@cloudflare/next-on-pages` or `pages_build_output_dir` without an explicit migration back to Pages.
- Remove `buildCommand: "next build"` from `open-next.config.ts` while `"build"` is OpenNext — that causes infinite `opennextjs-cloudflare build` recursion.
- Add a zone route `bilauitmcuti.com/_next/*` that steals apex calendar assets.

## Local verify

```bash
pnpm preview
# or
pnpm dev   # after wrangler login; OpenNext initOpenNextCloudflareForDev
```
